## NAME
vtium-gallery - show PNG pictures as thumbnails in a terminal that supports kitty graphics

## SYNOPSIS
@SYNOPSIS@

## DESCRIPTION
@DESCRIPTION@

A build of vtium with image support installs the program as `vtium-gallery`. It is a bash script, and it needs only bash and the usual base tools.

## OPTIONS
@OPTIONS@

## EXIT STATUS
= 0
It showed the pictures, or printed its help.

= 1
It found no PNG picture, or the terminal did not answer that it supports kitty graphics.

= 2
The command line is wrong, or a file or directory it names does not exist.

